{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_016_03_h",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:45e1695765d3f05eb4bc8d5c282918f8670c96907c811ced6d1685d4a4d239f2",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d6fe2786e4ae0b3ef5bd6dc26631aa89bfaf805e08e2b2234400a15244f9f51a",
      "text": "……我过一阵子再来看您。请多保重。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:104093dd34df918d6999bde33cef855c76162141c21477d2c38d999e6b88385e",
      "text": "那个，能耽误您一点时间吗？\n有关于您祖母的事情要跟您说。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb9eb93c59120e94cc1f77bac2249619e19be8f7e07b44c9c9a762ea03c8d137",
      "text": "好的。请问是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:541a204843ad2ff6a8115fde70472160e227e047e4dfd9795cffa26b0a44cc28",
      "text": "虽然时间不长的话，\n还是能正常说上话的状态……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f9ee6ba80d2a52c00ad2fb56f6f1f8908de3f81aeb3f4b270549c56b082172ef",
      "text": "但医生带话说，危险的状态还在持续，今晚恐怕会很难熬。\n您打算就这样留下来陪床吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000043:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:98739b95ccd71250c93eb093e8d38baf3f898a648b1a0e49967a79cf39a4611a",
      "text": "……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3768e462199c6836ed26bf502e8d822aca391828edc890255ad06a6fd62242d6",
      "text": "嗯，请务必让我留下来。\n……麻烦您了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0f69fab96c65984e0cd2383cf695355fa8adbb94d44ba45f538d75b246621d3a",
      "text": "……、呜……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:60e20872de502231326a6405a2eccfd237303fbde8ec2f426e0139376db52351",
      "text": "那些眼泪啊，是你的心\n在说“想要获得幸福”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f321290f4150727d4e0a94326a723ae869c078719ace77baa38865771f17310a",
      "text": "（……“想要获得幸福”？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7e565c53f72082373f3c9daa187352b9df20a71fea593c58e088bf26c497e26f",
      "text": "（在受到如此多的眷顾、肆意妄为之后……\n我居然还在想着那种事吗？）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000098:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:df3b11196c8c479b66362fffe586fe185b997837b288ff2315835af91cc34170",
      "text": "（我……怎么可能会被允许有那种奢望……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_016cfi_03_1_1_016_03:1_1_016_03_h:cmd-000103:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:94d187c8c0548ac4006a6c573b3c807cc929f680a6ebec11914c218541fd4b09",
      "text": "……就在那一天，祖母与世长辞了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
